## Prompt

```text
Make a narrowly targeted scientific correction in this existing German copolymer teaching image. Preserve ALL drawn beads, topology, colours and overall layout. REMOVE the exact letter-sequence captions underneath the homopolymer and graft-copolymer diagrams, since they falsely count six A units against nine drawn and five against six. Replace them with short large labels 'Nur A' and 'A-Kette, B-Äste' respectively. Also remove the unnecessary exact letter-sequence captions under statistical and block copolymers and replace them with large 'Gemischt' and 'A-Block + B-Block'; keep all bead counts and sequence relationships as drawn. Labels must be readable when whole image is316pxwide. Make the explanatory properties conditional by changing lower headings to 'Eigenschaften prüfen' and 'Kombination möglich' rather than automatic benefits/synergy guarantees; do not add tiny qualifiers. Keep existing coherent same teaching style and all surrounding content unless necessary to accommodate short large labels. Do not invent different monomer identities or incorrect counts.
```

